Nanosaur: controls
==================

The keys as the game sets them the first time (Settings, then Configure
keyboard, changes them; they are kept in the drawer's User drawer).

  Cursor keys          run forward and back, turn
  Space                fire
  Alt                  jump (press again in the air for the jet pack)
  A and Z              jet pack up and down
  Ctrl                 pick up
  Left Shift or ]      next weapon
  Right Shift or [     previous weapon
  Tab                  camera mode
  , and .              turn the camera
  1 and 2              zoom out and in
  G                    the map (GPS)
  M                    music on and off
  B                    ambient sound on and off
  Esc                  pause and the menu

The menu: cursor keys and Return, Esc goes back. A mouse (left button
fires), a joystick or a gamepad works too.
